Thu Aug 13 16:02:29 UTC 2026 - Fridrich Strba <fstrba@suse.com>

- Update to v1.23.0
  * Changes from v1.8.0 to v1.23.0:
    + Synced with Brotli v1.1.0 and v1.2.0.
    + Added support for s390x, riscv64, ppc64le, and armv7
      architectures.
    + Added JPMS support via a dedicated service module.
    + Added system property "brotli4j.library.path" to load
      from a custom path.
    + Added native binary validation script and integration
      checks.
    + Added per-pull output cap to the decoder.
    + Added utility method to determine maximum compressed
      size.
    + Prevented unintended garbage collection of raw data
      in PreparedDictionaryImpl.
    + Made several JNI methods and Encoder wrapper classes
      public.
    + Avoided array allocation in Encoder.Mode.of.
    + Fixed decompression when using NIO ByteBuffers.
    + Netty dependency upgrades.
- Modified patch:
  * brotli4j-loadlibrary.patch
    + Adapt to upstream shared library loader changes in
      v1.23.0.

